## Privacy

This software does **not** collect, store, transmit, or share any personal data, analytics, telemetry, or user information. All data (match scores, standings, schedules) is fetched from public APIs (TheSportsDB or a custom endpoint you configure) and processed locally in your browser. No data leaves your device except the API requests required to display match information.

